<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs rise 0.2 pct Jan-April.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs rise 0.2 pct Jan-April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs rose 0.2 percent to 28.9 million tonnes in the first four months of 1997, according to trade body Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that crude refinery runs fell 4.0 percent over this period while imported semi-finished products jumped 57.9 percent. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
